  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the roots be <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>22</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br />Since,&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>189</mn></math>, hence we will take the first case.<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\